        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PRRHCH, Port Royal Series Riversdale Entryset with Round Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditional Riversdale Entryset with Half-Round Knob features oval mounts. It is available in a single cylinder function where the deadbolt is operated by a key from the exterior and by a thumb-turn from the interior and the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by the knob from the interior and a thumb-press from the interior. It is also available in a dummy function which neither latches nor locks. This Riversdale Entryset with Round Knob is designed to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 2 inches thick with backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, polished brass, or oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/riversdale-handleset-with-chapelton-lever-deltana-prrhch\"><b>Riversdale Handleset with Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Riversdale Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI grade 2 security.</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway compatible.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Oval Riversdale Handleset with Round Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Top Mount Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handleset Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PRRHRK-specifications.pdf?v=1704262317\" target=\"new\"><b>Riversdale Single Cylinder Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the knob operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i>\r\n</p>",
